    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📥 YouTube Downloader Telegram Bot\n\n**Overview:**\nMulti-step conversational bot that validates incoming YouTube links, prompts the user to select video quality or audio format via inline buttons, triggers the Apify YouTube Downloader actor, and returns the media file back to Telegram.\n\n---\n\n### ⚙️ Workflow Steps:\n1. **Telegram Trigger:** Listens for text messages & callback queries (`inline_keyboard` clicks).\n2. **Validator / Router:** Regex checks the YouTube link & extracts canonical Video ID.\n3. **Quality Selection:** Prompts user with 1080p, 720p, 480p, 360p, or Audio options.\n4. **Apify Downloader Actor:** Fetches direct downloadable media stream.\n5. **Send to Telegram:** Delivers media (`Send Video` / `Send Audio`) directly to the user.\n\n---\n\n### 🔗 Example URL:\n`https://youtube.com/shorts/A4dYgziFpDw?si=qmDHjS-TEippuLeK`",
        "height": 592,
        "width": 640
      },
